  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Hurricane Preparedness Support Mechanism project seeks to support three strategic capacity and institutional strengthening interventions across Jamaica, Bahamas &amp; Bermuda through the implementation of the following activities: Activity 1.1. &#x2013; Conduct Regional Capacity Building Training in Hurricane Preparedness for key Umbrella organisations supporting Micro, Small &amp; Medium EnterprisesActivity 1.2. &#x2013; Host Resilience Series with countries covered by the MCOActivity 1.4. &#x2013; Conduct Hurricane Preparedness capacity building training for local disaster management authorities</narrative>
  </description>
